# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate*
terraform.tfstate.d/
terraform_states/**
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Secrets & generated credentials
keys/
*.p12
*-ca.pem

# VPN artifacts (Ansible `fetch` module output dirs, named after the fetched
# file, containing per-IP subdirectories with real VPN certs/keys)
vpns/*
**/client.ovpn/
**/support.ovpn/
**/labclient.ovpn/
**/labsupport.ovpn/
